              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni wibuke rero ingene wākiriye kandi wumvise: uvyitondere, wihane. Nuko rero n’utaba maso, nzoza nk’igisuma, nawe ntuzomenya igihe nzokwūbīra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
