        {
          "text": "Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Filadelufiya, ut’ Uwera, uw’ ukuri, ūfise urupfunguzo rwa Dawidi, uwugurura ntihagire uwugara, kand’ uwugara ntihagire uwugurura, aravuga ibi, ",
